8b04acbb68f702b45ec.poster.avif?t=1747719933\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/748e86138e0c28b04acbb68f702b45ec.webm?t=1747719933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/748e86138e0c28b04acbb68f702b45ec.mp4?t=1747719933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/ab3c1afae3a282c562448179f88389ce.avif?t=1747719933\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/0aa25ce0c8d34561914352112dc94c12.avif?t=1747719933\" data-has-big width=800 height=415 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to FaeTerra</strong>\u00a0- a vibrant, PvP-focused auto-battler where strategy meets charm. Build your  team from 121 adorable creatures, each with their own unique abilities and personalities. Master powerful synergies, outsmart your opponents in tactical battling, and rise through the ranks in competitive multiplayer battles. Whether you're a seasoned strategist or a creature collector at heart, FaeTerra offers endless replayability, with rich team-building and depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/a351bc93cb0341f33a81242b1c933636.avif?t=1747719933\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About FaeTerra:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> your friends in PVP, manage your team, evolve, and compete in battle!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> unique strategies and combos to create the most powerful team. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom builds</strong> allow you to craft their very own unique teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> and master  121 unique Fae's with 13  elemental types.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP ranked and Casual modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player leveling and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle pass with unique cosmetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player leveling and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presskit:\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/9fc8d5eea063e70f0814dff002f1414d.avif?t=1747719933\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/c3d596d48a9b2a88dfe155b5eec89626.avif?t=1747719933\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/035bbcc968217eee0f9fdc81e6a14184.avif?t=1747719933\" width=609 height=74 /></span></p>",
